                     <provenance type="#m"><orgName role="fmo" key="org_198">Eton, Buckinghamshire.
                           Royal College of the Assumption of Saint Mary the
                           Virgin</orgName><p>Contains the annotations of <persName>Robert
                              Elyot</persName>, fellow of Eton from c. 1474 until his death in
                           January 1499 (BRUO 638). He was a prolific annotator of books at Eton.
                           Five are particularly heavily marked and were probably his own,
                           subsequently given to the college: MSS 17, 18, 34, 36, 76. (His marks
                           were discussed by <bibl>N. R. Ker in <title>The Library</title>, 5th ser.
